Subject: [PATCH] Let owners delete the department they are in

A danger-zone card at the bottom of Access, for owners only. The owner types the department name to confirm. Deleting removes its employees, shifts, schedule, settings, store hours, access list and audit log, then opens another department the person belongs to. Refused if it is the person's only department.

